ge" class="wsb-canvas-page page" style="height: 3211px; margin: auto; width: 1000px; background-color: #ffffff; position: relative; margin-top: 450px"><div id="wsb-canvas-template-container" style="position: absolute;"> <div id="wsb-element-3335b5d2-5dfc-4151-b81c-588ac41507bd" class="wsb-element-text" data-type="element"> <div class="txt "><p><strong></strong>The Kennedy King Memorial Initiative builds on the historical events of April 4, 1968, to raise awareness, provoke thought and inspire action to eliminate division and injustice. The Kennedy King Memorial Initiative became a 501(C) 3 nonprofit organization in 2015.<br><br>We have big dreams and concrete plans to transform the Martin Luther King Park campus into a center where people, institutions, and community partners can come together in bold dialogue and purposeful action.<br><br>The violent deaths of Kennedy and King call for candid and courageous conversations on how individuals, families and communities can address this scourge that wounds civil society. We are:<strong><br><br></strong></p><ul><li><strong>Creating original programs that teach, support, and inspire</strong></li></ul><p><strong><br></strong></p><ul><li><strong>Convening candid and courageous conversations</strong></li></ul><p><strong><br></strong></p><ul><li><strong>Collaborating with organizations that align with our mission</strong></li></ul><p><strong><br></strong></p><ul><li><strong>Cultivating a strong and vital King Park community</strong><br></li></ul></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-1567a967-9dd1-4c0e-9004-1affbb5d3954" class="wsb-element-image" data-type="element"> <div class="wsb-image-inner "><div class="img"><img src="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nebula.wsimg.com/e61eba993a4670f6f16cbac49604315a?AccessKeyId=F2087FD4A34D4A8050BA&disposition=0&alloworigin=1"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 //nebula.wsimg.com/e61eba993a4670f6f16cbac49604315a?AccessKeyId=F2087FD4A34D4A8050BA&amp;disposition=0&amp;alloworigin=1}}" style="vertical-align:middle;width:498px;height:332px;"></div></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-384c509a-c871-48c2-bde6-9a76cec7a902" class="wsb-element-text" data-type="element"> <div class="txt "><p><a href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wfyi.org/news/articles/kennedy-king-memorial-initiative-unveils-new-permanent-exhibit"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 https://www.wfyi.org/news/articles/kennedy-king-memorial-initiative-unveils-new-permanent-exhibit}}" target="_blank">Kennedy King Memorial Initiative Unveils New Permanent Exhibit - WFYI</a></p><p><a href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wishtv.com/news/local-news/special-exhibit-marks-54th-anniversary-of-kennedy-speech-king-assassination/"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 https://www.wishtv.com/news/local-news/special-exhibit-marks-54th-anniversary-of-kennedy-speech-king-assassination/}}" target="_blank">Special exhibit marks 54th anniversary of Kennedy speech, King assassination - WISH-TV</a><br></p><p><a href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.wthr.com/article/news/local/city-announces-5-million-capital-campaign-for-dr-martin-luther-king-jr-park-location-sidewalks-lights/531-586349eb-7654-4684-bf85-d23088c229c8"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 https://www.wthr.com/article/news/local/city-announces-5-million-capital-campaign-for-dr-martin-luther-king-jr-park-location-sidewalks-lights/531-586349eb-7654-4684-bf85-d23088c229c8}}" target="_blank">City announces $5 million capital campaign for Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. Park - WTHR-TV</a><br></p><p><a href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nba.com/pacers/news/kennedy-king-memorial-initiative-pacers-sports-entertainment-program-will-shine-light-indys"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 https://www.nba.com/pacers/news/kennedy-king-memorial-initiative-pacers-sports-entertainment-program-will-shine-light-indys}}" target="_blank">Kennedy King Memorial Initiative, Pacers Sports &amp; Entertainment Program Will Shine Light on Indy's Marvelous Potential - NBA.com</a><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-0e70885c-b0c7-47f9-ae02-74bbd13641f4" class="wsb-element-image" data-type="element"> <div class="wsb-image-inner "><div class="img"><img src="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nebula.wsimg.com/cb3045a2c25c9140ea89127296c8770a?AccessKeyId=F2087FD4A34D4A8050BA&disposition=0&alloworigin=1"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 //nebula.wsimg.com/cb3045a2c25c9140ea89127296c8770a?AccessKeyId=F2087FD4A34D4A8050BA&amp;disposition=0&amp;alloworigin=1}}" style="vertical-align:middle;width:554px;height:139px;"></div></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-fec3dcf7-ffc5-4101-a385-0cfe95624148" class="wsb-element-shape" data-type="element"> <div class="wsb-shape shape_line "></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-f08a93ea-84b1-4993-b8f3-322088b8facb" class="wsb-element-button" data-type="element"> <div><a id="wsb-button-f08a93ea-84b1-4993-b8f3-322088b8facb" class="wsb-button button_header " href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.kennedykingnbhd.org/about-us.html"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 about-us.html}}"><span class="button-content wsb-button-content" style="white-space:nowrap">Learn More</span></a></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-6c4fa145-5aae-4b98-924b-6b15f0d2e9a8" class="wsb-element-button" data-type="element"> <div><a id="wsb-button-6c4fa145-5aae-4b98-924b-6b15f0d2e9a8" class="wsb-button button_fb " href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://facebook.com/kennedykingnbhd"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 http://facebook.com/kennedykingnbhd}}" target="_blank"><span class="button-content wsb-button-content" style="white-space:nowrap">Enter text</span></a></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-80ba01f9-430c-4c8e-aefc-3afde55bd300" class="wsb-element-text" data-type="element"> <div class="txt "><p><strong>OFFICIAL HASHTAGS: #STILLWEREACH #KENNEDYKING</strong></p></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-1e7b6404-2d5a-43db-aa7b-36909614266f" class="wsb-element-text" data-type="element"> <div class="txt "><p><strong>Donate to Our Mission</strong></p></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-8f319248-5283-4c04-9f04-668ca4e5afe5" class="wsb-element-text" data-type="element"> <div class="txt "><p>The&nbsp;Landmark for Peace&nbsp;is a memorial sculpture in Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. Park on the northside of&nbsp;Indianapolis. It honors the contributions of the slain leaders&nbsp;Robert F. Kennedy&nbsp;and&nbsp;Martin Luther King Jr.&nbsp;The memorial, which features Kennedy and King reaching out to each other, was designed and executed by Indiana artist Greg Perry. The bronze portraits were created by Indianapolis sculptor&nbsp;Daniel Edwards.<br><br>On April 4, 2018, the memorial was designated as the&nbsp;Kennedy-King National Commemorative Site.</p></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-378e5687-2a12-4753-9ded-c797bad9bf99" class="wsb-element-image" data-type="element"> <div class="wsb-image-inner "><div class="img"><img src="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nebula.wsimg.com/538bfa5005344bfa81aad15052c6a1cc?AccessKeyId=F2087FD4A34D4A8050BA&disposition=0&alloworigin=1"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 //nebula.wsimg.com/538bfa5005344bfa81aad15052c6a1cc?AccessKeyId=F2087FD4A34D4A8050BA&amp;disposition=0&amp;alloworigin=1}}" style="vertical-align:middle;width:808px;height:300px;"></div></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-e1f53174-dab5-4f75-9598-7d028b9daae7" class="wsb-element-shape" data-type="element"> <div class="wsb-shape shape_skybox "></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-c8055f4f-e1a1-4784-9ab9-57888b912869" class="wsb-element-text" data-type="element"> <div class="txt "><p><strong>KKMI in the News</strong></p></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-8e5512a1-6fad-499b-bbb7-5811389e19db" class="wsb-element-youtube" data-type="element"> <div><div class="youtube"><iframe src="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/embed/A2kWIa8wSC0?feature=oembed&wmode=opaque&autoplay=0"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 //www.youtube.com/embed/A2kWIa8wSC0?feature=oembed&wmode=opaque&autoplay=0}}" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" style="width:100%;height:100%;"></iframe></div></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-9dd8cf24-5cae-4e3e-8945-e1ac5442dd42" class="wsb-element-button" data-type="element"> <div><a id="wsb-button-9dd8cf24-5cae-4e3e-8945-e1ac5442dd42" class="wsb-button button_tw " href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://twitter.com/kennedykingnbhd"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 http://twitter.com/kennedykingnbhd}}" target="_blank"><span class="button-content wsb-button-content" style="white-space:nowrap">Enter text</span></a></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-3d556ef0-16a7-42ce-82a9-6a4f2063749c" class="wsb-element-shape" data-type="element"> <div class="wsb-shape shape_headerbg "></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-d56933cb-51fd-4099-82d8-74ad7acfe0d2" class="wsb-element-line" data-type="element"> <div class="wsb-line-element" style="width: 200px; height: 20px; width: 200px;border-top: 2px solid #999;opacity: 1;filter: alpha(opacity=1);"></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-5c19b461-02d1-47e4-ba11-43761c400f8d" class="wsb-element-button" data-type="element"> <div><a id="wsb-button-5c19b461-02d1-47e4-ba11-43761c400f8d" class="wsb-button customStyle " href="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://crm.bloomerang.co/HostedDonation?ApiKey=pub_45c1bfc1-85ba-11e6-9d49-0a1b37ae639f&WidgetId=69632"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 https://crm.bloomerang.co/HostedDonation?ApiKey=pub_45c1bfc1-85ba-11e6-9d49-0a1b37ae639f&WidgetId=69632}}" target="_blank"><span class="button-content wsb-button-content" style="white-space:nowrap">Donate Now via Bloomerang</span></a></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-d6fd8e1d-c978-4d09-bf73-18ee52512210" class="wsb-element-text" data-type="element"> <div class="txt "><p>On April 4, 1968, Robert F. Kennedy announced the death of Martin Luther King, Jr. to a majority-black crowd in an Indianapolis park. His impromptu speech is regarded as one of the most powerful and important addresses in American history. Kennedy's speech - equal parts eulogy and call for peace - came as America was erupting into violence. Because of his message of compassion, the crowd in Indianapolis returned home peacefully. As cities across America burned, Indianapolis remained peaceful.</p></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-43deae92-9db4-432f-9d47-54b1654abea2" class="wsb-element-text" data-type="element"> <div class="txt "><p style="text-align: center;"><strong>The Speech of Sen. Robert (Bobby) Kennedy</strong></p></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-63e55b62-1507-4171-8aae-9297fa9fcb4d" class="wsb-element-text" data-type="element"> <div class="txt "><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;"><span style="font-size:96px;">Kennedy-King</span></span></p><h3 class="editor_TopSubHeader" style="text-align: center;">Neighborhood Association</h3><h3 style="text-align: center;"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;"><em><span style="font-size:18px;">Indianapolis, Indiana</span></em></span><br></h3><p><br></p></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-53763376-6dcc-4f13-9cfa-ae6ad0710426" class="wsb-element-image" data-type="element"> <div class="wsb-image-inner "><div class="img"><img src="{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://nebula.wsimg.com/98e9588c3ecd3998810694b65891b0c1?AccessKeyId=F2087FD4A34D4A8050BA&disposition=0&alloworigin=1"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 //nebula.wsimg.com/98e9588c3ecd3998810694b65891b0c1?AccessKeyId=F2087FD4A34D4A8050BA&amp;disposition=0&amp;alloworigin=1}}" style="vertical-align:middle;width:382px;height:255px;"></div></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-8e0762a3-da50-443f-a2ed-dab1c258a81f" class="wsb-element-text" data-type="element"> <div class="txt "><p>Support our work by making&nbsp;a tax-deductible contribution to the Kennedy King Memorial Initiative.</p></div> </div><div id="wsb-element-c211f7f9-e732-4a9c-9047-b61e3c44f943" class="wsb-element-image" data-type="element"> <div class="wsb-image-inner "><div class="img"><a href="{\field{